      "limits": [
        "The attempt is not refused when quantity exceeds patient count, occupied beds, or daily discharge capacity; resulting overcommitment remains visible.",
        "The cohort illness stage is retained because a partial cohort discharge cannot be represented separately.",
        "Ventilators are released by an autonomous stock process rather than by this action because the ventilator stock is not an action participant."
